<p>RORO KE BAYA.N KARTE THEY RUNME SHAHE WAALA as</p>

<p>BE DUST HUA NEHER PA SAQQAE SAKEENA sa</p>

<p>1.ABBAS as KE LAASHE PA YE KEHTE THEY SHAHE DEE.N.</p>

<p>MARNE TERE MERI KAMAR TOOTI HAI BHAYYA.</p>

<p>2.KHAEGI SAKEENA sa MERI ZAALIM KE TAMAACHE</p>

<p>TAPKEGA LAHOO KANO.N SE JAL JAEGA KURTA.</p>

<p>3.SEENE PA SINA KHAEGA HUM SHAKLE PAYAMBER saws.</p>

<p>KUCH DEIR ME HOJAEGA SHABBIR as AKELA.</p>

<p>4.MAA FATEMA ZAHRA sa KO RULAEGA LAHAD ME.</p>

<p>GHODE SE ZAMEE.N PAR WO TERA MOO.N KE BAL AANA.</p>

<p>5.KHANJAR THA RAWA.N GARDAN E SHABBIR as PA JISDUM.</p>

<p>SHABBIR as NE ABBAS as KO RORO KE PUKARA.</p>

<p>6.BOLE SHAHE WALA as AEY SAKEENA as MERI BETI.</p>

<p>DARIYA KE KANARE TERA AMMU GAYA MAARA.</p>

<p>7.RUQ KARKE SUWE NEHER YE ZAINAB as NE SADA DI.</p>

<p>TUM HI TOW MUHAFIZ MERI CHAADAR KE THEY BHAYYA.</p>

<p>8.QAIMON ME ALAM AAYA JO ABBAS as KA AARIF</p>

<p>SHABBIR as KE LAB PAR YEHI NOHA THA KHUDARA.</p> 